<p>
  Find instant answers to common questions about the 2026 Sur-Ron Light Bee X, free shipping, 100-day warranty, 30-day returns, and off-road legality.
</p>

<h2>Vehicle & Legality</h2>

<div class="faq-detail">
  <div class="faq-summary">Is the Light Bee street legal?</div>
  <div class="faq-answer">
    <p><strong>NO — off-road use only.</strong> The Sur-Ron Light Bee X is engineered specifically as a high-performance off-road electric dirt bike. It is not street legal for use on public streets, highways, or sidewalks in most jurisdictions. It is intended for private property and designated OHV trails.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="faq-detail">
  <div class="faq-summary">What are the rider age and weight requirements?</div>
  <div class="faq-answer">
    <p>We recommend riders be at least <strong>16 years of age or older</strong>. Minors should always ride with adult supervision. The maximum recommended rider weight payload is <strong>220 lbs (100 kg)</strong> for optimal speed, hill climb, and suspension performance.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="faq-detail">
  <div class="faq-summary">What's included in the box?</div>
  <div class="faq-answer">
    <p>Every shipment includes: (1) 2026 Sur-Ron Light Bee X, (2) Removable Lithium-Ion Battery Pack with BMS, (3) High-Output Fast Charger, (4) 2 Ignition Keys, (5) Front Wheel & Axle Assembly, (6) Front Fender, (7) Gripped Footpegs, (8) Metric Tool Kit, and (9) Owner's Manual.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="faq-detail">
  <div class="faq-summary">Is assembly required?</div>
  <div class="faq-answer">
    <p>The bike arrives <strong>approximately 90% pre-assembled</strong> in a protective shipping crate. Assembly takes only 30–45 minutes using the included tool kit: attach the handlebar, mount the front wheel, bolt on the front fender, and install the footpegs.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<h2>Shipping & Tracking</h2>

<div class="faq-detail">
  <div class="faq-summary">How long does shipping take?</div>
  <div class="faq-answer">
    <p>We offer <strong>100% FREE 7-day shipping to all 50 US states</strong>. Orders are processed and dispatched within 24 to 48 business hours. Delivery typically takes 5–7 business days.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="faq-detail">
  <div class="faq-summary">How do I track my order?</div>
  <div class="faq-answer">
    <p>You will receive an automated email with your freight tracking number within 24 hours of package handoff, directly trackable on FedEx or UPS websites.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="faq-detail">
  <div class="faq-summary">What if my bike arrives damaged?</div>
  <div class="faq-answer">
    <p>All shipments are <strong>100% insured</strong> against damage. Simply note the damage on the delivery slip before signing, take clear photos, do not assemble the bike, and email <a href="mailto:contact@bikebee.shop">contact@bikebee.shop</a> within 48 hours for immediate resolution.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<h2>Returns, Warranty & Financing</h2>

<div class="faq-detail">
  <div class="faq-summary">What is your return policy?</div>
  <div class="faq-answer">
    <p>We offer a <strong>30-day money-back guarantee</strong> for unused, unridden bikes in their original packaging. See our <a href="/pages/refund-policy">Refund Policy</a> for return instructions.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="faq-detail">
  <div class="faq-summary">What warranty do you offer?</div>
  <div class="faq-answer">
    <p>Every bike comes with a <strong>100-day warranty</strong> covering factory defects in the motor, lithium battery pack, motor controller, and main frame.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="faq-detail">
  <div class="faq-summary">Do you offer financing?</div>
  <div class="faq-answer">
    <p>Yes! We offer monthly installment financing options at checkout through Shop Pay, allowing you to split your purchase into convenient payments.</p>
  </div>
</div>

